          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            Learn to prepare traditional handmade pasta with fresh local
            ingredients, including malloreddos, ravioli, and macarrones de busa.
            A local expert shares Sardinian culinary traditions and the history
            behind its iconic recipes before you enjoy the dishes prepared
            together. An expert in traditional Sardinian gastronomy guides you
            through the foods, landscapes, and knowledge that define the island.
          </p>
          <dl
            class="mt-4 grid gap-2 border-t border-[#3c5546]/15 pt-4 text-sm sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div>
              <dt class="font-bold text-[#3c5546]">Place</dt><dd>Alghero</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="font-bold text-[#3c5546]">Reservation</dt><dd>
                Before departure
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="font-bold text-[#3c5546]">Rates</dt><dd>
                According to the number of participants
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="font-bold text-[#3c5546]">Group size</dt><dd>
                6 to 12 participants
              </dd>
