            Sa Mandra Traditional Sardinian Dinner Experience
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            Enjoy an evening at the renowned Sa Mandra Agriturismo near Alghero.
            In a rural farmhouse surrounded by nature, savour a traditional
            tasting menu made with fresh, locally sourced ingredients, many
            produced on the farm. Featured in the Michelin Guide for four
            consecutive years, Sa Mandra is celebrated for its farm-to-table
            philosophy and commitment to Sardinian culinary heritage.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            This optional dinner is available for guests who would like to
            discover one of Sardinia's finest farm-to-table restaurants.
            Montaraz Outdoors &amp; Culture can make the reservation on your
            behalf while tables are available.
          </p>
          <dl
            class="mt-4 grid gap-2 border-t border-[#3c5546]/15 pt-4 text-sm sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div>
              <dt class="font-bold text-[#3c5546]">Place</dt><dd>Alghero</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="font-bold text-[#3c5546]">Reservation</dt><dd>
                Before departure
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="font-bold text-[#3c5546]">Estimated price</dt><dd>
                EUR 60 to EUR 70 per person
              </dd>
